# Courtship without marriage (T-109): an optional, all-ages path for the eight romanceable villagers. Ask at 8 hearts (and again at 10 if the player said "not yet"), a partners scene at 10 hearts, and a few partner lines. One courtship at a time. Compiled to zz_fs_courtship.json.

dialogue wren.courtship
n0 wren: What do you say?
  ? I'd like to court you. => r0 | friend:wren,20 | flag:choice.courtship.wren.yes
  ? Let's stay the best of friends. => r1 | friend:wren,15 | flag:choice.courtship.wren.friends
  ? Can we wait a while? => r2 | friend:wren,5 | flag:choice.courtship.wren.later
r0 wren: Court. Oh. Yes. Properly, with walks and terrible poems. I'll write the first one tonight and burn it.
  expr happy
r1 wren: Friends. Yes. The best kind. You keep the good stool, and I keep talking too much. I'm relieved. Mostly.
  expr happy
r2 wren: Wait. Fair. I've waited eight years for a decent stool. I can wait for the right moment.
  expr thinking

dialogue wren.partners
n0 wren: The good stool's free and the night's young. How shall we spend it?
  ? Listen to the whole song. => r0 | friend:wren,10 | flag:choice.courtship.wren.song
  ? Dance with her between the tables. => r1 | friend:wren,10 | flag:choice.courtship.wren.dance
  ? Walk her home under the stars. => r2 | friend:wren,10 | flag:choice.courtship.wren.walk
r0 wren: Every verse! Oh, you angel. I'll sing the bridge twice, because it's my favorite.
  expr happy
r1 wren: Dance! In the saloon! The floor's sticky and I don't care. Hold on.
  expr happy
r2 wren: A walk home. Past the store, past Tilda's lamp, past all my old excuses. Lead on.
  expr happy

addto npc.wren.talk
0 flag:partners.wren => wren.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Good morning, you. I woke up with the chorus in my head. It was yours.
0 flag:partners.wren => wren.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come sit. The stool's warm. I warmed it. For you.
0 flag:partners.wren => wren.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Every night, one verse. By winter we'll have an album, and no one's allowed to review it.

dialogue hazel.courtship
n0 hazel: What do you say?
  ? Yes. I'd like that very much. => r0 | friend:hazel,20 | flag:choice.courtship.hazel.yes
  ? I'd rather we stay friends. => r1 | friend:hazel,15 | flag:choice.courtship.hazel.friends
  ? Give me a little time. => r2 | friend:hazel,5 | flag:choice.courtship.hazel.later
r0 hazel: Yes. (That's the whole sentence.) I'll write the rest later. Please stay a while.
  expr happy
r1 hazel: Friends. A good word. A whole chapter, not a footnote. Thank you for saying it kindly.
  expr happy
r2 hazel: Time. Of course. Books wait on shelves for years. (I'll aim for less.)
  expr thinking

dialogue hazel.partners
n0 hazel: (You came.) The afternoon is ours. How shall we spend it?
  ? Read the page together. => r0 | friend:hazel,10 | flag:choice.courtship.hazel.read
  ? Hold her hand over the desk. => r1 | friend:hazel,10 | flag:choice.courtship.hazel.hand
  ? Walk with her to the forest. => r2 | friend:hazel,10 | flag:choice.courtship.hazel.walk
r0 hazel: (Aloud. Both of us.) It sounds truer in two voices. I didn't know that about pages.
  expr happy
r1 hazel: (Oh.) Your hand is warm. Mine is ink-stained. (They match anyway.)
  expr embarrassed
r2 hazel: The forest. With you. The birds will be loud. (Let them. I'll be listening to you.)
  expr happy

addto npc.hazel.talk
0 flag:partners.hazel => hazel.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: (You came.) The chair is yours. It's always yours now. I labeled it.
0 flag:partners.hazel => hazel.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: I put a bookmark in the day. It's for later, with you.
0 flag:partners.hazel => hazel.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come, sit. (I'll read, you listen, and we'll both pretend it's about the book.)

dialogue juno.courtship
n0 juno: My ears are hot. Say something before I label them.
  ? Yes! Read me the list. => r0 | friend:juno,20 | flag:choice.courtship.juno.yes
  ? I'd rather we stayed friends. => r1 | friend:juno,15 | flag:choice.courtship.juno.friends
  ? Can I think about it? => r2 | friend:juno,5 | flag:choice.courtship.juno.later
r0 juno: Yes? YES. Okay. I need a minute, and also a hammer. Courting! You and me!
  expr happy
r1 juno: Friends! Oh. Okay! Good! The best kind! ...I'll label it 'Friends (Very Good)'. Thank you for saying it straight.
  expr happy
r2 juno: Think! Yes! Take your time! I'll be right here, polishing one clasp very slowly, not watching the door.
  expr thinking

dialogue juno.partners
n0 juno: Okay, okay, okay. Forge is banked, evening's free. What are we doing?
  ? Admire the tiny anvil. => r0 | friend:juno,10 | flag:choice.courtship.juno.anvil
  ? Take her to the beach. => r1 | friend:juno,10 | flag:choice.courtship.juno.beach
  ? Hold her hand at the forge. => r2 | friend:juno,10 | flag:choice.courtship.juno.hand
r0 juno: It's perfect, right? It rings if you tap it with a pin. I tested it twice. Once on Bram.
  expr happy
r1 juno: The beach! With sand! I'll bring a clasp for luck, and a sandwich. Not for the clasp.
  expr happy
r2 juno: Okay. Yes. Hands. I'm very warm. That's the forge. Definitely the forge. Don't let go.
  expr embarrassed

addto npc.juno.talk
0 flag:partners.juno => juno.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Good morning, hi! I made a tea. I didn't label it. That's how you know it's serious.
0 flag:partners.juno => juno.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come here, come here. I want to show you a tiny hinge. It's the best thing today. Second best.
0 flag:partners.juno => juno.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Forty items on the list, and now it's forty-one. The new one's 'This'.

dialogue piper.courtship
n0 piper: What do you say?
  ? Yes. Sing me the love song. => r0 | friend:piper,20 | flag:choice.courtship.piper.yes
  ? I'd rather we stay friends. => r1 | friend:piper,15 | flag:choice.courtship.piper.friends
  ? Give me a verse or two. => r2 | friend:piper,5 | flag:choice.courtship.piper.later
r0 piper: Yes! Then the love song's yours. It rhymes! It has a bridge! I'm going to be insufferable.
  expr happy
r1 piper: Friends. That's a good song too. I'll still play your requests first. Thanks for the honest note.
  expr happy
r2 piper: A verse or two. Fair. It's a long song. I'll leave the last line open.
  expr thinking

dialogue piper.partners
n0 piper: No gig tonight. Just us. What's the set list?
  ? Hear the whole song. => r0 | friend:piper,10 | flag:choice.courtship.piper.song
  ? Sing the chorus with her. => r1 | friend:piper,10 | flag:choice.courtship.piper.duet
  ? Walk her home after the set. => r2 | friend:piper,10 | flag:choice.courtship.piper.walk
r0 piper: Every note? Oh, you star. If I wobble on the high part, blame the lamps.
  expr happy
r1 piper: A duet! You know the words! ...I wrote them yesterday. How do you know the words?
  expr happy
r2 piper: A walk home after. The night's quiet. I'm loud. Let's see who wins.
  expr happy

addto npc.piper.talk
0 flag:partners.piper => piper.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Hi, you. I woke up humming. It was about you. It's always about you now. It's a problem. It's lovely.
0 flag:partners.piper => piper.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come to the front row. I'll save you the best seat. It's the one by the speaker.
0 flag:partners.piper => piper.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Every night, a new line. By spring we'll have a whole musical. It'll be dreadful and perfect.

dialogue felix.courtship
n0 felix: What do you say?
  ? Yes. I'd like that. => r0 | friend:felix,20 | flag:choice.courtship.felix.yes
  ? I'd rather we stayed friends. => r1 | friend:felix,15 | flag:choice.courtship.felix.friends
  ? Give me a little time. => r2 | friend:felix,5 | flag:choice.courtship.felix.later
r0 felix: Yes! Oh. Best catch of my life, and I wasn't even holding a rod. Dawn tomorrow. The good rock.
  expr happy
r1 felix: Friends. That's a fine thing. The best dawn partners are friends. I'm glad. I'll be a bit quiet today.
  expr happy
r2 felix: A little time. Good. Fish take time. So does the rest of it.
  expr thinking

dialogue felix.partners
n0 felix: Tide's out. Morning's ours. What'll it be?
  ? Listen to the shell. => r0 | friend:felix,10 | flag:choice.courtship.felix.shell
  ? Fish together at dawn. => r1 | friend:felix,10 | flag:choice.courtship.felix.fish
  ? Watch the sunrise with him. => r2 | friend:felix,10 | flag:choice.courtship.felix.sun
r0 felix: Hear it? That's the sea. It's saying something. I think it's saying your name. It could be 'hello'.
  expr happy
r1 felix: Two lines and the good rock. You hold the rod. I'll hold the thermos. Finest morning there is.
  expr happy
r2 felix: The sun comes up. We don't say much. The fish don't mind. Neither do I.
  expr happy

addto npc.felix.talk
0 flag:partners.felix => felix.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Morning. I saved you the good rock. It's warm. I warmed it. Sit.
0 flag:partners.felix => felix.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: I caught one this big. Bigger. I'll tell you later. Slowly. With your hand in mine.
0 flag:partners.felix => felix.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Every dawn, two lines. By winter we'll have the pond figured out. Or we won't. That's fine, too.

dialogue dorian.courtship
n0 dorian: What do you say?
  ? Yes. I'd like that. => r0 | friend:dorian,20 | flag:choice.courtship.dorian.yes
  ? I'd rather we stayed friends. => r1 | friend:dorian,15 | flag:choice.courtship.dorian.friends
  ? Can we wait a while? => r2 | friend:dorian,5 | flag:choice.courtship.dorian.later
r0 dorian: ...Yes. I wasn't sure. I'll show you the quiet places. All of them. Slowly.
  expr happy
r1 dorian: Friends. ...Good. That's a lot, for me. You said it gently.
  expr happy
r2 dorian: Wait. Yes. I'm good at waiting. Ask any oak.
  expr thinking

dialogue dorian.partners
n0 dorian: ...An evening. Ours. I didn't plan past this.
  ? Hold the feather carefully. => r0 | friend:dorian,10 | flag:choice.courtship.dorian.feather
  ? Walk the forest with him. => r1 | friend:dorian,10 | flag:choice.courtship.dorian.walk
  ? Sit. Say nothing. Together. => r2 | friend:dorian,10 | flag:choice.courtship.dorian.sit
r0 dorian: Soft, isn't it. I found it the day we met. Kept it. For later.
  expr happy
r1 dorian: The forest, then. I'll show you the old oak. Best listener I know.
  expr happy
r2 dorian: ...Yes. This. We never needed words. Still don't.
  expr happy

addto npc.dorian.talk
0 flag:partners.dorian => dorian.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: ...Morning. The oak asked about you. I said you were well. It was pleased.
0 flag:partners.dorian => dorian.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come. I found a clearing. It's small. It's ours.
0 flag:partners.dorian => dorian.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: I used to love the quiet because it was empty. Now I love it because it's yours too.

dialogue elara.courtship
n0 elara: Read the last row. Out loud, if you like. ...What do you say?
  ? Yes! Show me the whole scarf. => r0 | friend:elara,20 | flag:choice.courtship.elara.yes
  ? I'd rather we stayed friends. => r1 | friend:elara,15 | flag:choice.courtship.elara.friends
  ? Let me think. Knit slowly. => r2 | friend:elara,5 | flag:choice.courtship.elara.later
r0 elara: YES! Oh, my needles are shaking! The scarf is yours! All of it! I measured! It's very long!
  expr happy
r1 elara: Oh. ...Friends! The best kind! I'll knit you a friend-sized scarf. Same length, more pockets. Thank you for saying it kindly.
  expr happy
r2 elara: Think! Take all the time you need! I'll add a row a day. The scarf will just... get longer. That's fine!
  expr thinking

dialogue elara.partners
n0 elara: Dr. Penn gave me the afternoon off! She said 'go' twice, so I went. How shall we spend it?
  ? Put the hat on. All three. => r0 | friend:elara,10 | flag:choice.courtship.elara.hat
  ? Teach me to knit a row. => r1 | friend:elara,10 | flag:choice.courtship.elara.knit
  ? Beach walk, till the sun goes down. => r2 | friend:elara,10 | flag:choice.courtship.elara.beach
r0 elara: Oh, you look wonderful! The tiniest hat is crooked. It's perfect. I'm a little teary. Happy teary!
  expr happy
r1 elara: Hold this needle! No, the other end! There! We made a row! It's the best row in Wetherell!
  expr happy
r2 elara: The beach at sunset! I'll bring a blanket and three snacks. The snacks are yours. The blanket is ours.
  expr happy

addto npc.elara.talk
0 flag:partners.elara => elara.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Good morning! I knitted a sock! It's for you! It's the left one! The right one's tomorrow!
0 flag:partners.elara => elara.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come in, come in! I saved you a spot on the couch! It has a blanket! I made the blanket!
0 flag:partners.elara => elara.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: A row a day, with you! By winter we'll have a scarf that reaches the beach! I measured!

dialogue ione.courtship
n0 ione: What do you say? Take your time. I'll pretend to shelve something.
  ? Yes. I'd like that very much. => r0 | friend:ione,20 | flag:choice.courtship.ione.yes
  ? I'd rather we stayed good friends. => r1 | friend:ione,15 | flag:choice.courtship.ione.friends
  ? Could we wait a while? Bookmark it? => r2 | friend:ione,5 | flag:choice.courtship.ione.later
r0 ione: Yes. ...Oh, good. Good. I'll clear a shelf for the two of us. A small one, by the window.
  expr happy
r1 ione: Friends. That's a lovely thing to be, and the best stories start there. You were kind to say it plainly.
  expr happy
r2 ione: Wait. Of course. A good book isn't rushed. I'll keep the question by the desk bell.
  expr thinking

dialogue ione.partners
n0 ione: I've set the rest of the day aside for you. How shall we spend it?
  ? Listen to all four pages. => r0 | friend:ione,10 | flag:choice.courtship.ione.letter
  ? Read to her among the stacks. => r1 | friend:ione,10 | flag:choice.courtship.ione.read
  ? Walk the shore. The letter can come too. => r2 | friend:ione,10 | flag:choice.courtship.ione.walk
r0 ione: Every word. Thank you. ...I'm the one blushing, and I wrote it.
  expr embarrassed
r1 ione: You read, and the books lean in. They've missed being listened to. ...So had I.
  expr happy
r2 ione: The shore, with you. I'll bring a book and not open it. From a librarian, that's devotion.
  expr happy

addto npc.ione.talk
0 flag:partners.ione => ione.partners.talk0 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Good morning. I set aside a chair by the window. It has a cushion. It's yours.
0 flag:partners.ione => ione.partners.talk1 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Come, sit. I'll read, you rest. The books won't mind. They think you're one of us.
0 flag:partners.ione => ione.partners.talk2 cat=reactive tag=wholesome :: Every evening, a chapter. By winter we'll be at the end. I'll write a second book, just so we don't stop.
